  "summary": "For over 20 years, I have been a Software Engineer at Principal Financial Group, a global leader in retirement and investment solutions. I develop and maintain applications using Java and COBOL, working in an Agile environment and using tools such as Spring, Maven, Sonar, CICS, JCL, and Sapiens. I am also a certified AWS Cloud Practitioner, with knowledge of cloud computing concepts and best practices.\n\nAs a Software Engineer, I contribute to the delivery of high-quality products and services that meet the needs and expectations of our clients and stakeholders. I collaborate with cross-functional teams, follow coding standards and guidelines, perform testing and debugging, and troubleshoot issues. I also continuously learn and update my skills, staying on top of the latest technologies and trends in the industry. I am passionate about creating innovative and efficient solutions that enhance the user experience and support the company's mission and vision.",
